        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Booking is simple: call the dedicated contact number, fill out the online request form, or use the WhatsApp option on our website. Provide pickup and delivery addresses, preferred moving date, and a brief inventory. Our team confirms availability within hours and shares a free, detailed quote for the Dumka‑to‑Godda corridor.</p>
