        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is my furniture protected during the 850 km transit from Dumka to Godda?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging combines heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated sheets, and stretch film. Each item is secured inside GPS‑tracked enclosed containers with hydraulic ramps, and our crew follows the 4‑protocol zero‑damage system, guaranteeing safe arrival even over long distances.</p>
