      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time on the Dumka‑Godda route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every container is equipped with satellite GPS that streams live location data to our customer portal. You receive a unique tracking ID and can monitor the exact position of your goods, estimated arrival time, and any route updates directly from your smartphone or computer.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included for household goods on this corridor?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All moves include 100 % declared‑value marine transit insurance approved by IRDAI. The policy covers loss, theft, and accidental damage up to the full market value of each item. Optional higher‑value coverage can be added at the time of booking for valuable antiques, artwork, or electronics.</p>
